OL,3,CPolice appeal for witnesses after
OL,4,Clorry driver, 20, killed in motorway
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FPolice are appealing for witnesses
OL,8,Fafter a lorry driver died when his
OL,9,Fvehicle left the road on the M3.
OL,11,FThe incident happened at around 10pm
OL,12,Fon Tuesday evening along the
OL,13,Fsouthbound carriageway between J13 and
OL,14,FJ14.
OL,16,FNo other vehicles were involved.
OL,18,FThe 20-year-old, male, driver of the
OL,19,Florry was pronounced dead at the
OL,20,Fscene. His next of kin have been
OL,21,Finformed.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/3
