OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786537137
OL,3,CPolice appeal for witnesses after
OL,4,Clorry driver, 20, killed in motorway
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FThe vehicle was travelling on the slip
OL,8,Froad for the M27 westbound, when it
OL,9,Fleft the carriageway and came to a
OL,10,Frest on land near Chestnut Avenue.
OL,12,FThe two left lanes, which lead to the
OL,13,Fslip road, have been closed while
OL,14,Femergency services investigate the
OL,15,Fcause of the incident.
OL,17,FChestnut Avenue has also been shut
OL,18,Fbetween Nightingale Avenue and
OL,19,FFalkland Road
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/3
