OL,3,CPolice appeal for witnesses after
OL,4,Clorry driver, 20, killed in motorway
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FThe closures are expected to remain in
OL,8,Fplace throughout today.
OL,10,FAnyone who witnessed the incident or
OL,11,Fmoments leading up to it has been
OL,12,Fasked to contact Hampshire and Isle of
OL,13,FWight Police.
